<% content_for :title, "Identity provider unavailable" %>

<div class="panel">
  <h1>Identity provider not configured</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    F1 authenticates through an approved managed identity service, fixed by a signed
    release artifact (<code>f1-managed-identity-redirect-v1</code>). No identity provider
    is configured for this environment, so no account can be created or signed in to.
  </p>
  <p>
    This is a deployment prerequisite, not a fault in the application: the authorization
    endpoint, client, receipt issuer and audience, callback URI and JWKS URL all come
    from that artifact and cannot be supplied by request or environment.
  </p>
</div>
